    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nModeChanged event is triggered when message window is resized, even when mode hasn't changed.\n\nthis is caused by `norm! Gzb` in ui2/messages.lua.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```nushell\nnvim --clean -c \"lua require'vim._core.ui2'.enable { msg = { targets = 'msg' } }\" -c 'au ModeChanged i:n echoerr \"\"' -c 'echo \"a\" | echo \"b\" | startinsert'\n```\nthis throws an error after timeout, witch means mode changed to normal mode from insert mode when message window was resized.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nModeChanged not triggerd.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-18T11:33:39Z",
